# Normalise source and prose to LF in the repository, as usual.
*.c     text
*.h     text
*.md    text
*.ps1   text
Makefile text
*.bat   text eol=crlf

# The two Windows listings are byte-exact captures of `tree /F` and
# `tree /F /A`, carriage returns included, and the tests assert on their
# bytes. Line-ending conversion would quietly turn them into something
# Windows never produced, so they are excluded from it. The 0xA6 byte they
# contain is not valid UTF-8 either, which is another reason not to let any
# filter near them.
tests/fixtures/win_tree_f.txt        -text
tests/fixtures/win_tree_f_ascii.txt  -text
